OL,3,GNEWSAMP petition after review of
OL,4,Aambulance stations
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ambulance service has said vehicles
OL,7,Fwill remain positioned according to
OL,8,Fdemand after an MP has started a
OL,9,Fpetition "opposed to the closure of
OL,10,Fambulance facilities".
OL,12,FSouth East Coast Ambulance Service
OL,13,F(Secamb) says it will "review its
OL,14,Fexisting estate" in Hampshire and west
OL,15,FSurrey after securing a site for an
OL,16,Fambulance centre in Farnborough.
OL,18,FGuildford MP Zoe Franklin has started a
OL,19,Fpetition warning of a "real
OL,20,Fpossibility" the area could be left
OL,21,F"without a single permanent ambulance
OL,22,Fstation" and opposing any closures.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
