OL,3,GNEWSAMP petition after review of
OL,4,Aambulance stations
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecamb said ambulances "would continue
OL,7,Fto operate within the communities they
OL,8,Fserve via a network response posts"
OL,9,Fwhere on-call ambulances wait to be
OL,10,Fdeployed.
